				"⠃⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				972,
				40
			],
			"Message": "feat(Wind): Add Decorations, Keybinding, Lifecycle, and WorkingCopy services\n\nImplement four new Effect-TS service layers in Wind that connect to Mountain via Tauri IPC:\n\n- **DecorationsService**: Manages file/folder decorations (badges, tooltips, colors) shown in explorer tree. IPC: decorations:get, getMany, set, clear.\n- **KeybindingService**: Manages dynamic keyboard shortcut registration and lookup. IPC: keybinding:add, remove, lookup, getAll.\n- **LifecycleService**: Tracks editor startup/shutdown phases (Starting, Ready, Restored, Eventually). IPC: lifecycle:getPhase, whenPhase, requestShutdown.\n- **WorkingCopyService**: Tracks dirty state of open editor resources (unsaved changes). IPC: workingCopy:isDirty, setDirty, getAllDirty, getDirtyCount.\n\nEach service includes interface, stub implementation, live IPC layer, mock layer, Effect Context tag, and problem types following Wind's established pattern.\n\nAlso reformat ESBuild configuration files in Configuration/ESBuild/ for consistency with recent commits.",
			"SHA": "1b4d4b79d033b15d16230420993723dd053b05f4"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-04-06T05:12:23Z",
			"File": [
				"⣿⡏⠀⠀⠀",
				924,
				300
			],
			"Message": "style(Wind): Reformat ESBuild configuration and clean up declaration files\n\nReformat all ESBuild configuration files in Configuration/ESBuild/ and Source/ from minified single-line format to properly formatted, readable code with consistent spacing, indentation, and line wrapping. Changes include:\n- Expand minified import statements (e.g., `import*as e from\"...\"` → `import * as e from \"...\"`)\n- Replace single-letter variable names with descriptive names (e.g., `r` → `BaseConfig_default`, `e` → `Environment`)\n- Apply consistent named exports format\n- Add proper line breaks and indentation\n- Reformat all constant, config, and index files\n\nAdditionally, clean up the Target/Source/ directory by removing old TypeScript declaration files (.d.ts) and their source maps (.d.ts.map), as these intermediate build artifacts are no longer needed.\n\nThis follows the same reformatting pattern as the previous commit for Target output files, completing the standardization of Wind's build configuration.",
			"SHA": "041f9fa293ba8c8c9f66543853f4381ac59861f7"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-04-06T04:53:55Z",
			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				1489,
				3
			],
			"Message": "feat(Wind): Add ShowOpenDialog and ShowSaveDialog to FilesService\n\nAdd native file dialog methods to the FilesService interface, stub, and live implementation. ShowOpenDialog returns selected URIs (with options for title, filters, multi-select, folder selection), while ShowSaveDialog returns a selected path (with options for title, defaultUri, filters). The live implementation uses IPC to invoke UserInterface.ShowOpenDialog and UserInterface.ShowSaveDialog on the Mountain backend, completing the file dialog integration in Wind's service layer.",
			"SHA": "05bb6c3ae1af67aabbdd5489c81362653cc30d0f"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-04-06T04:06:34Z",
			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				1489,
				2
			],
			"Message": "style(Wind): Use POSIX sh shebang for build scripts\n\nUpdate the shebang line in both Source/Run.sh and Source/prepublishOnly.sh from `#!/usr/bin/env bash` to `#!/usr/bin/env sh` for improved portability across Unix-like systems.\n\nThis ensures the build scripts can execute on systems where bash may not be installed or available at the standard path, adhering to POSIX compatibility standards.",
			"SHA": "2c942308aa79bd450545ad2868729a8dc4dac8aa"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-04-06T03:36:59Z",
			"File": [
				"⣿⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				1489,
				300
			],
			"Message": "style(Wind): Reformat ESBuild configuration and Target output from minified to readable\n\nReformat all ESBuild configuration files in Configuration/ESBuild/ and compiled Target output files from minified single-line format to properly formatted, readable code with consistent spacing, indentation, and line wrapping.\n\nChanges include:\n- Expand minified import statements (e.g., `import*as e from\"...\"` → `import * as e from \"...\"`)\n- Apply consistent named exports format\n- Add proper line breaks and indentation\n- Reformat all constant, config, and index files\n\nAlso applies minor formatting fix to Source/Effect/Files/Interface/FilesService.ts for consistent Stat method signature style.",
			"SHA": "81826d3c729fce04a2f5bbd0d8390525d2a4caff"
		}
